msgid "How much do fireworks cost in Phuket?"
msgstr "在普吉岛放烟花需要多少钱？"

msgid "As a broad guide, our featured displays are around ฿40,000+, ฿70,000+ and ฿108,000+. We prepare a written quote once we know your date, venue and desired display."
msgstr "大致而言，我们的主推烟花表演约为 ฿40,000+、฿70,000+ 和 ฿108,000+。了解您的日期、场地和期望的表演后，我们会提供书面报价。"

msgid "What can change the final price?"
msgstr "哪些因素会影响最终价格？"

msgid "The starting ranges exclude 7% VAT, permission fees, venue charges and special logistics. A floating firing platform, if needed, is quoted separately. Your written quote sets out the final price and inclusions."
msgstr "起价不含 7% 增值税、许可费用、场地费用及特殊物流。如需浮动燃放平台，将另行报价。最终价格及包含内容以书面报价为准。"

msgid "How long does a display last?"
msgstr "一场表演持续多长时间？"

msgid "Our current display options range from a short moment of under a minute to approximately four minutes. The actual duration depends on the firing sequence, venue and confirmed design."
msgstr "目前的表演方案从不到一分钟的短暂时刻到约四分钟不等。实际时长取决于燃放编排、场地和最终确认的设计。"

msgid "Can fireworks be arranged at any hotel or beach?"
msgstr "任何酒店或海滩都可以放烟花吗？"

msgid "Not every location is suitable. Venue rules, firing position, access, surroundings and approvals are checked before confirmation."
msgstr "并非所有地点都适合。确认前我们会核查场地规定、燃放位置、进场条件、周边环境及审批情况。"

msgid "Can you arrange a “Marry Me” proposal or sparklers?"
msgstr "可以安排“Marry Me”求婚或仙女棒吗？"

msgid "Tell us the moment you imagine. We can discuss fire letters spelling “Marry Me”, illuminated proposal letters, sparklers and fireworks with your planner or venue. Each element depends on venue rules, availability and a separate written quote."
msgstr "告诉我们您想象中的那一刻。我们可以与您的策划师或场地讨论“Marry Me”火焰字、发光求婚字母、仙女棒和烟花。每项内容都取决于场地规定、可行性及单独的书面报价。"

msgid "What is included in a proposal package?"
msgstr "求婚套餐包含哪些内容？"

msgid "The Intimate Reveal, The Sparkling Yes and The Grand Proposal are planning starting points. Fireworks guide prices apply to the display only. Letters, decor, photography, live performance, venue costs and other additions are itemised separately in your written quote."
msgstr "“温馨揭晓”、“闪耀的 Yes”和“盛大求婚”是筹备的起点。烟花参考价仅适用于烟花表演本身。字母、布置、摄影、现场表演、场地费用及其他附加项目会在书面报价中单独列出。"

msgid "Are fire letters available at every venue?"
msgstr "每个场地都能使用火焰字吗？"

msgid "No. Fire letters need a suitable outdoor location and specific venue approval. Tell us your preferred venue so we can check availability and discuss an illuminated alternative if open flame is not suitable."
msgstr "不是。火焰字需要合适的户外场地并获得场地的明确许可。请告诉我们您心仪的场地，我们会核实可行性；如不适合明火，可讨论发光字替代方案。"

msgid "Are colourful daytime effects available?"
msgstr "可以安排彩色日间效果吗？"

msgid "They may be possible for suitable events. Share your venue and the effect you have in mind so we can check the location, availability and approval requirements."
msgstr "部分活动可以。请告诉我们场地和您想要的效果，我们会核实地点、可行性及审批要求。"

msgid "Can the display be launched from a barge or floating platform?"
msgstr "可以从驳船或浮动平台燃放烟花吗？"

msgid "A floating platform may be needed when there is no suitable approved firing position at the venue. The current estimate is roughly ฿40,000–฿60,000 or more in addition to the display, subject to sea conditions, access and supplier availability."
msgstr "当场地没有合适且获批的燃放位置时，可能需要浮动平台。目前估价约为 ฿40,000–฿60,000 或以上（另加烟花表演费用），视海况、进场条件及供应商档期而定。"

msgid "How many fire dancers can we book?"
msgstr "可以预订几位火舞演员？"

msgid "We offer shows with two to five dancers, with starting guides from ฿25,000+. The right number depends on your venue, guest experience and preferred show style."
msgstr "我们提供 2 至 5 位演员的表演，参考起价 ฿25,000+。合适的人数取决于您的场地、宾客体验和偏好的表演风格。"

msgid "What kinds of fire dance shows are possible?"
msgstr "可以安排哪些类型的火舞表演？"

msgid "Ask about synchronized duos, choreographed group routines and effects such as poi, staff or fans. Specific props, performance length and staging are confirmed with the artists and venue in your quote."
msgstr "可咨询同步双人舞、编排好的群舞，以及火球、火棍或火扇等道具。具体道具、表演时长和舞台安排会在报价中与演员和场地确认。"

msgid "Can a fire dance show be combined with fireworks?"
msgstr "火舞表演可以和烟花一起安排吗？"

msgid "Yes, we can plan them as separate moments in the same event, subject to artist availability, venue suitability and the necessary approvals. The two services are quoted separately."
msgstr "可以，我们可以把它们安排为同一活动中的不同环节，视演员档期、场地条件及所需审批而定。两项服务分别报价。"

msgid "Do you also cover Khao Lak and Krabi?"
msgstr "考拉和甲米也提供服务吗？"

msgid "Yes, subject to venue suitability, operator availability and the proposed firing location."
msgstr "是的，视场地条件、团队档期及拟定燃放位置而定。"

msgid "How far in advance should I book?"
msgstr "需要提前多久预订？"

msgid "Please allow at least 7–14 days for permission arrangements, excluding weekends and public holidays. Contact us as soon as your date and venue are known; some venues and locations may need longer."
msgstr "办理许可至少需要 7–14 天（不含周末和公共假日）。确定日期和场地后请尽快联系我们；部分场地和地点可能需要更长时间。"

msgid "Can you coordinate directly with my wedding planner or hotel?"
msgstr "可以直接与我的婚礼策划师或酒店对接吗？"

msgid "Yes. We can liaise directly with your planner, hotel or venue team to align timing, access and requirements."
msgstr "可以。我们可以直接与您的策划师、酒店或场地团队沟通，统一时间、进场及各项要求。"

